Our changes
-----------

The custom-wow branch adds merchant characters, an era allow-list, learned
market prices and listing tempo. Those commits modify
src/AuctionHouseBot.cpp, src/AuctionHouseBot.h, src/AuctionHouseBotScript.cpp
and conf/mod_ahbot.conf.dist, so our changes to them are offered under the same
terms as the file they change: GPL-2.0-or-later for the AuctionHouseBot files,
GNU AGPL v3 for AuctionHouseBotScript.cpp.

Upstream has been asked to add a LICENSE file. If one lands, it governs and
this note should be replaced by it.

The combined server binary
--------------------------

AzerothCore links its modules statically. Built into the worldserver alongside
AGPL-3.0 modules, the combined binary is AGPL-3.0, and anyone who runs that
server for other people must offer them its source. The files in this
repository keep the terms above.
